{
  "datasets": [
    {
      "name": "perf_summary",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Performance Summary",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `performance_group`, `product_count`, `total_pieces_sold`, `average_pieces_per_product`, `minimum_pieces_per_product`, `maximum_pieces_per_product`, `average_catalog_list_price`, `median_catalog_list_price`\n",
        "FROM sales_data_cc.gold.task2_performance_summary\n",
        "ORDER BY `performance_group`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "attribute_deltas",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Top 10% vs Bottom 10% Attribute Deltas",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `attribute_name`, `attribute_value`, `top_10_percent_product_count`, `top_10_percent_share_of_group`, `bottom_10_percent_product_count`, `bottom_10_percent_share_of_group`, `share_delta_percentage_points`, `skews_towards`\n",
        "FROM sales_data_cc.gold.task2_top_10_vs_bottom_10_attribute_deltas\n",
        "ORDER BY ABS(`share_delta_percentage_points`) DESC, `attribute_name`, `attribute_value`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "timing_summary",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Sales Timing Summary",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `performance_group`, `product_count`, `average_active_sale_months_per_product`, `share_of_products_selling_in_a_single_month`, `share_of_products_selling_in_all_sale_months`, `average_pieces_sold_per_active_month`, `in_season_share_of_group_pieces`\n",
        "FROM sales_data_cc.gold.task2_sales_timing_summary\n",
        "ORDER BY `performance_group`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "month_share_deltas",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Monthly Share Deltas (Top 10% vs Bottom 10%)",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `sale_month`, `top_10_percent_share_of_group`, `bottom_10_percent_share_of_group`, `share_delta_percentage_points`, `skews_towards`\n",
        "FROM sales_data_cc.gold.task2_month_share_deltas\n",
        "ORDER BY `sale_month`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "activity_breadth",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Activity Breadth by Performance Group",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT `performance_group`, `active_sale_months_tier`, `product_count`, `share_of_group`\n",
        "FROM sales_data_cc.gold.task2_activity_breadth_by_group\n",
        "ORDER BY `performance_group`, `active_sale_months_tier`"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "lifetime_pieces_mass_points",
      "displayName": "Task 2 - Lifetime Pieces Mass Points (1-100 range)",
      "queryLines": [
        "SELECT\n",
        "  `total_pieces_sold`,\n",
        "  COUNT(*) AS product_count,\n",
        "  CASE\n",
        "    WHEN SQRT(`total_pieces_sold`) = FLOOR(SQRT(`total_pieces_sold`)) THEN 'perfect square'\n",
        "    ELSE 'other'\n",
        "  END AS value_type\n",
        "FROM\n",
        "  sales_data_cc.gold.task2_product_performance\n",
        "WHERE\n",
        "  `total_pieces_sold` BETWEEN 1 AND 100\n",
        "GROUP BY\n",
        "  1,\n",
        "  3\n",
        "ORDER BY\n",
        "  1"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "best_vs_worst_page",
      "displayName": "Top 10% vs Bottom 10% Products",
      "layout": [
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "task2_methodology_header",
            "spec": {
              "encodings": {
                "text": {
                  "fields": [],
                  "lines": [
                    "# How the top 10% / bottom 10% groups are defined\n",
                    "\n",
                    "Groups are cut by **percent-rank on lifetime pieces sold**, with ties sharing one rank, not raw min/max — raw values are degenerate (201 products tie at 1 piece sold, 202 tie at 9,801), so a plain extremes split would be meaningless. The resulting groups: **top 10% = 2,011 products**, **middle 80% = 16,059 products**, **bottom 10% = 2,182 products**.\n",
                    "\n",
                    "**No catalog attribute separates the deciles by more than ~2.7 percentage points** (origin is the largest gap) — the signal in this data is weak almost everywhere *except* one place: **active selling months**. Top-10% products are associated with selling in nearly every month (99.95% sold in all 11 months); bottom-10% products are associated with selling in very few (4.46 months on average, 10.3% in only one month). That association — not any single attribute — is the strongest pattern this data shows.\n"
                  ]
                }
              },
              "version": 1,
              "verticalAlign": "top",
              "widgetType": "text"
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "activity_breadth_bar",
